  awayInterceptionsSecondHalf        Int?
  awayOffsidesFirstHalf              Int?
  awayOffsidesSecondHalf             Int?
  awayPassesAccurateFirstHalf        Int?
  awayPassesAccurateSecondHalf       Int?
  awayPassesTotalFirstHalf           Int?
  awayPassesTotalSecondHalf          Int?
