  awayShotsInsideBoxFirstHalf        Int?
  awayShotsInsideBoxSecondHalf       Int?
  awayShotsOffTargetFirstHalf        Int?
  awayShotsOffTargetSecondHalf       Int?
  awayShotsOnTargetFirstHalf         Int?
  awayShotsOnTargetSecondHalf        Int?
  awayShotsOutsideBox                Int?
  awayShotsOutsideBoxFirstHalf       Int?
  awayShotsOutsideBoxSecondHalf      Int?
  awayShotsSecondHalf                Int?
